{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:42 2026-07-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:42 2026-07-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:42 2026-07-08 HKT</p><p>今晚快活谷第二場四班一六五○米，黃寶妮策騎石廄的「暴風之子」一放到底勝出。</p><p>賽後練馬師徐雨石說：「『暴風之子」今仗頭段放得超快，幸好在二及三段按慢步速，讓馬匹有回氣的空間。此外，今晚場地利前領馬，對『暴風之子』有利，用黃寶妮減七磅有利，亦幫到手。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be9c45c5b1ea7233ad323ed0ca78f62f/2026-07/1ae5563f-f65d-4e41-b561-c08c2fdce681.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/077dc203d2999100c03d2d2094e4b656/2026-07/4f56f4ad-573a-4aff-8b36-24b38f98c6a0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4a75df0758530cabf647da9eb8dd24fc/2026-07/5caf0bda-74d1-4f5a-95f3-4be6867f9dd5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7cfae7bdc348012d35d7a1a70fcc940a/2026-07/8e0d1e2f-54bb-454b-bc6a-63ea859bf8f9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/40bfcb65fd06a8795a533533204b062d/2026-07/66d0ea94-3a19-4fc0-85fb-b78d7c54c6bd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/440918a2af2a65db04292cb40d13109d/2026-07/615be086-e0cd-4a00-95be-bbbee81cb6f4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/73d13b9a41924e05c968885031187cf2/2026-07/5317dd89-6a6b-4cdd-868d-9c12370dcd39.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c0e020e88d7544a0ef6ee583232f67b/2026-07/8021b751-25ae-49aa-88f2-9e44f799d5da.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e7e7308e130684b4e0339b5a96ca1185/2026-07/a5a8d39c-d1c2-4374-8fee-1375a1662334.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c2eaa93d61f5bbe1450ec2d373b967b4/2026-07/a9c3126f-431d-46f3-b021-1118888ddaed.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c1687c331206062a125baf82ffc0708/2026-07/aa56c341-2117-4509-bd63-8180fe2f1e88.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb554116680340d48cd47317d3733825/2026-07/c7b4b696-46b4-4dd9-a87a-17f7079a56e8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0